      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "To check the leak sensor, locate the sensor on the dishwasher's bottom panel, usually between the lower rack and the floor. Gently pull the panel back to access the sensor. Look for the sensor cable and check for any moisture or debris at the connection point, then inspect the pump inlet hose for any signs of a leak.dry the sensors with a soft cloth, make sure not to touch any electrical components.",
